+## 8. Tests (TDD, failing first)
+
+`tests/Feature/QueuesUiTest.php` (use `RefreshDatabase`; helpers: entity+owner
+factory, `CreateQueue`, `SetQueueAccess`, `IssueTicket`):
+
+1. Manager creates queue via component → row active/slugged/scoped; form reset.
+2. Employee render/create → 403 / `AuthorizationException`, count 0.
+3. Duplicate name same entity → validation error on name (derived slug
+   collides), count unchanged.
+4. Rename happy + rename collision → validation; tamper id from entity B →
+   404, queue unchanged.
+5. Deactivate → `is_active=false`; `IssueTicket` + `CallNextTicket` then throw
+   `InactiveQueueException`; tickets intact. Reactivate reverses.
+6. Access: grant `call` → employee `Gate::allows('call')` false→true;
+   revoke `[]` → row gone, denied again.
+7. Access unauthorized: employee `openAccess/grantAccess` → 403, nothing
+   written. Foreign membership → scoped lookup 404s, no row.
+8. Access audit: `Log::fake()` asserts `audit` grant + revoke entries.
+9. View asserts per role: status + key markup + accessible labels.
+
+`tests/Feature/ServeUiTest.php`:
+
+10. Renders callable queues only (granted A not B; owner sees all; outsider 403).
+11. `callNext` with grant → ticket `Called`, `called_by` set, list shrinks,
+    last-called shown.
+12. `callNext` without grant → `AuthorizationException`, ticket stays `Waiting`,
+    `called_*` unchanged.
+13. Tamper `selectedQueueId` (other entity / ungranted queue) → 404/403, no
+    mutation.
+14. Mode coverage: one filtered-mode (`PriorityOnly` or `NormalOnly`) denied +
+    one happy case.
+15. Inactive queue → `InactiveQueueException` notice; empty queue → empty state.
+16. View asserts: controls labelled, table columns present, last-called
+    notification after success.
+
+Regression: full `./bin/pf shell php artisan test` green, incl. existing
+`QueueManagementTest / QueueAccessTest / QueueAuthorizationTest / CallNextTicketTest`.
